      "writtenOn": "2022-02-14T17:18:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e As for consistent behavior, you are right. This solution will get less content if it\u0027s already inside a  saveLayer .\n\nA more simple \u0026 common example would be to just try to apply an alpha animation to the backdrop view. That is fairly common as a transition animation.",
      "parentUuid": "c67a9a62_10438c51",
      "revId": "c1db6d44ff43b9c9cc754b77592fbd769ae46917",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
